stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Normal
  Normal --> Normal: order rests or trades at several prices
  Normal --> Exclusive: trade at price P opens a workup at P
  Exclusive --> Exclusive: participant trades at P; timer restarts
  Exclusive --> Exclusive: outsider's marketable order is held
  Exclusive --> Open: exclusive window ends; held orders trade at P
  Open --> Open: anyone trades at P; timer restarts
  Open --> Open: order that would trade at another price is held
  Open --> Normal: workup timer expires; held orders processed in arrival order
  note right of Exclusive
    execution reports carry 9504=X
  end note
  note right of Open
    execution reports carry 9504=W
  end note
